<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 12:15:21 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>正如帆船由风提供动力一样，太空科学家和工程师梦想有一天航天器可以由太阳帆提供动力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/just-as-sailboats-are-powered-by-the-wind-space-scientists-and-engineers-dream-of-a-day-when-spacecraft-can-be-powered-by-solar-sails</link><description>这将如何运作？太阳一直在释放辐射。照射到大型、闪亮、帆状结构的辐射会推动它，就像风推动帆船一样。尽管推力非常轻柔，但却是持续不断的。随着时间的推移，宇宙飞船将行驶得非常非常快，根本不使用任何燃料！ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/just-as-sailboats-are-powered-by-the-wind-space-scientists-and-engineers-dream-of-a-day-when-spacecraft-can-be-powered-by-solar-sails.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 12:15:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/just-as-sailboats-are-powered-by-the-wind-space-scientists-and-engineers-dream-of-a-day-when-spacecraft-can-be-powered-by-solar-sails</guid></item><item><title>下一代 CRISPR 已经到来 | Trevor Martin 博士 — Mammoth Biosciences 首席执行官</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-next-generation-of-crispr-has-arrived-dr-trevor-martin-ceo-mammoth-biosciences</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 12:00:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-next-generation-of-crispr-has-arrived-dr-trevor-martin-ceo-mammoth-biosciences</guid></item><item><title>为什么情报界押注于生物技术|杰西卡戴蒙德博士，博士— In-Q-电话</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/why-the-intelligence-community-is-betting-on-biotechnology-dr-jessica-dymond-ph-d-in-q-tel</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 11:45:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/why-the-intelligence-community-is-betting-on-biotechnology-dr-jessica-dymond-ph-d-in-q-tel</guid></item><item><title>毅力号火星车捕捉到清晰如昼的火星远景</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/perseverance-rover-captures-mars-vista-as-clear-as-day</link><description>美国宇航局毅力号火星探测器的成像团队利用这颗红色星球的晴朗天空，捕捉到了迄今为​​止其任务中最清晰的全景图之一。马赛克由 96 张在科学团队称为“Falbreen”的地点拍摄的图像拼接而成，在马赛克中可以看到一块岩石似乎位于沙波纹之上，沙波纹是两个地质单元之间的边界线，还有远达 40 英里（65 公里）远的山丘。增强颜色版本显示火星天空非常清晰且具有迷惑性的蓝色，而在自然颜色版本中，它是微红色的。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/perseverance-rover-captures-mars-vista-as-clear-as-day2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 11:30:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/perseverance-rover-captures-mars-vista-as-clear-as-day</guid></item><item><title>肠道细菌留下肠道“记忆”，防止炎症</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/gut-bacteria-leave-intestinal-memory-protecting-against-inflammation</link><description>发表在《自然通讯》上的西北医学新研究表明，肠道细菌消化膳食纤维时产生的代谢物可以在肠道细胞上留下持久的分子印记，促进免疫耐受，并在接触结束后很长时间内防止炎症性肠病等病症。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/gut-bacteria-leave-intestinal-memory-protecting-against-inflammation.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 11:15:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/gut-bacteria-leave-intestinal-memory-protecting-against-inflammation</guid></item><item><title>亿万富翁家得宝 (Home Depot) 联合创始人伯尼·马库斯 (Bernie Marcus) 的基金会捐赠近 3000 万美元用于心脏病干细胞研究</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/billionaire-home-depot-cofounder-bernie-marcus-foundation-donates-nearly-30-million-toward-stem-cell-research-for-heart-attacks</link><description>马库斯的遗产继续存在，他的慈善基金会现在向他最初的热情之一致敬：医学。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/billionaire-home-depot-cofounder-bernie-marcus-foundation-donates-nearly-30-million-toward-stem-cell-research-for-heart-attacks.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 11:00:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/billionaire-home-depot-cofounder-bernie-marcus-foundation-donates-nearly-30-million-toward-stem-cell-research-for-heart-attacks</guid></item><item><title>科学家们知道，一项有争议的阿尔茨海默氏症手术据说可以逆转症状</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-controversial-alzheimers-surgery-is-said-to-reverse-symptoms-scientists-know</link><description>令人瞠目结舌的患者视频和神奇的见证在中国引发了人们对一项旨在改善大脑引流的技术的狂热。现在它正在全球范围内进行试验。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-controversial-alzheimers-surgery-is-said-to-reverse-symptoms-scientists-know.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 10:45:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-controversial-alzheimers-surgery-is-said-to-reverse-symptoms-scientists-know</guid></item><item><title>Machine Party，由 Buckshot Roulette Dev 开发的残酷游戏，获得 Couch CoOp</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/machine-party-brutal-game-by-buckshot-roulette-dev-gets-couch-coop</link><description>Machine Party 是一款由开发商 GDeavid 和 Mike Klubnika（Buckshot Roulette 和 Buckshot Roulette 的创造者）最近发布的残酷派对游戏合集。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/machine-party-brutal-game-by-buckshot-roulette-dev-gets-couch-coop.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 10:30:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/machine-party-brutal-game-by-buckshot-roulette-dev-gets-couch-coop</guid></item><item><title>数据中心通奸者</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/data-center-fornicator</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 10:15:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/data-center-fornicator</guid></item><item><title>最后一代完全可升级的个人电脑目前正在制造中</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-last-generation-of-fully-upgradeable-pcs-is-being-built-right-now<